function entityCode(id){let h=0;for(const c of String(id||''))h=(h*31+c.charCodeAt(0))>>>0;return String(h%1000).padStart(3,'0')}
function withCode(item){return item?item.name+' · #'+entityCode(item.id):''}
const DEFAULT_CLASS='d2';const DEFAULT_SCHOOL='school-demo';let school={schools:[{id:DEFAULT_SCHOOL,name:'בית ספר אופק',ownerId:'michal'},{id:'school-second',name:'בית ספר ניצנים',ownerId:'michal'}],schoolId:DEFAULT_SCHOOL,classes:[{id:'d2',name:'ד׳2',schoolId:DEFAULT_SCHOOL},{id:'d3',name:'ד׳3',schoolId:DEFAULT_SCHOOL},{id:'second-d2',name:'ד׳2',schoolId:'school-second'}],students:[{id:'noam-demo',name:'נועם לוי',classIds:['d2']},{id:'maya-demo',name:'מאיה כהן',classIds:['d2']},{id:'tal-demo',name:'טל ישראלי',classIds:['d3']}],teachers:[{id:'michal',name:'מיכל כהן',classIds:['d2','d3','second-d2']},{id:'yael',name:'יעל ישראלי',classIds:['d2']}],classId:'d2',studentId:'noam-demo',teacherId:'michal'};
try{const saved=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('homework-school-v1'));if(saved?.classes?.length&&saved.students&&saved.teachers)school=saved}catch{}
school.schools=school.schools||[{id:DEFAULT_SCHOOL,name:'בית הספר שלי',ownerId:'michal'}];school.schoolId=school.schoolId||DEFAULT_SCHOOL;school.staff=school.staff||[{schoolId:DEFAULT_SCHOOL,userId:'manager-demo',role:'manager'}];for(const c of school.classes)c.schoolId=c.schoolId||DEFAULT_SCHOOL;
function saveSchool(){if(cloud.ready)return true;try{localStorage.setItem('homework-school-v1',JSON.stringify(school));return true}catch{alert('שמירת הכיתות נכשלה.');return false}}
function activeSchoolId(){return school.schoolId}function activeSchool(){return school.schools.find(s=>s.id===school.schoolId)}function activeClassId(){return school.classId}function activeStudentId(){return school.studentId}function activeTeacher(){return school.teachers.find(t=>t.id===school.teacherId)}function activeStudent(){return school.students.find(s=>s.id===school.studentId)}
function teacherHasClass(){return !!activeTeacher()?.classIds.includes(activeClassId())}
function taskCompletion(r){return r.completions?.[activeStudentId()]||{done:false,completedAt:null}}
function classRecords(){return records.filter(r=>r.classId===activeClassId()).map(r=>({...r,...taskCompletion(r)}))}
async function setStudentCompletion(r,done){if(cloud.ready){try{await cloudCompleteLesson(r,done)}catch(e){cloudMessage('שמירת ההכנה נכשלה: '+e.message);return}}if(!school.students.some(s=>s.id===activeStudentId()&&s.classIds.includes(activeClassId())))return;const original=records.find(x=>x.classId===r.classId&&x.day===r.day&&x.subject===r.subject);if(!original)return;const previous={...(original.completions||{})};original.completions={...previous,[activeStudentId()]:{done,completedAt:done?new Date().toISOString():null}};if(!save())original.completions=previous;else if(typeof trackUsage==='function')trackUsage('completion_saved');render()}
function renderClasses(){
 const schoolSelect=document.getElementById('activeSchool'),classSelect=document.getElementById('activeClass'),studentSelect=document.getElementById('activeStudent'),teacherSelect=document.getElementById('activeTeacher');const availableSchools=role==='manager'?school.schools.filter(s=>school.staff.some(m=>m.schoolId===s.id&&m.userId==='manager-demo'&&m.role==='manager')):role==='teacher'?school.schools.filter(s=>s.ownerId===school.teacherId||school.staff.some(m=>m.schoolId===s.id&&m.userId===school.teacherId&&m.role==='teacher')||school.classes.some(c=>c.schoolId===s.id&&activeTeacher()?.classIds.includes(c.id))):school.schools;if(!availableSchools.some(s=>s.id===school.schoolId))school.schoolId=availableSchools[0]?.id||'';const available=school.classes.filter(c=>c.schoolId===school.schoolId&&(role!=='teacher'||activeTeacher()?.classIds.includes(c.id)));
 if(!available.some(c=>c.id===school.classId))school.classId=available[0]?.id||'';
 const students=school.students.filter(s=>s.classIds.includes(school.classId));if(!students.some(s=>s.id===school.studentId))school.studentId=students[0]?.id||'';
 const fill=(select,items,value)=>{select.replaceChildren();for(const item of items){const o=document.createElement('option');o.value=item.id;o.textContent=withCode(item);select.append(o)}select.value=value};fill(schoolSelect,availableSchools,school.schoolId);fill(classSelect,available,school.classId);fill(studentSelect,students,school.studentId);fill(teacherSelect,school.teachers,school.teacherId);
 document.getElementById('teacherSelector').hidden=role!=='teacher'||cloud.enabled;document.getElementById('classAdministration').hidden=role!=='teacher';document.getElementById('classIdentity').textContent=`${withCode(activeStudent())||'אין תלמידים בכיתה'} · ${withCode(school.classes.find(c=>c.id===school.classId))||'אין כיתות'} · ${withCode(activeSchool())}`;
 document.getElementById('childName').textContent=withCode(activeStudent())||'—';document.getElementById('className').textContent=withCode(school.classes.find(c=>c.id===school.classId))||'—';
 document.getElementById('schoolName').textContent=withCode(activeSchool())||'—';document.getElementById('addClass').disabled=!activeSchoolId();document.getElementById('addStudent').disabled=!teacherHasClass();document.getElementById('addTeacher').disabled=!teacherHasClass();document.getElementById('add').disabled=role==='teacher'&&(!teacherHasClass()||(typeof teacherPermission==='function'&&!teacherPermission('can_update_lessons')));const roster=document.getElementById('classRoster');roster.replaceChildren();for(const student of students){const tasks=records.filter(r=>r.classId===school.classId&&r.kind==='task');const done=tasks.filter(r=>r.completions?.[student.id]?.done).length;const row=document.createElement('p');row.textContent=withCode(student)+' · '+done+' מתוך '+tasks.length+' משימות הוכנו';roster.append(row)}
 const assignments=document.getElementById('teacherAssignments');assignments.replaceChildren();for(const teacher of school.teachers){const label=document.createElement('label');label.style.cssText='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:8px 0';const input=document.createElement('input');input.type='checkbox';input.style.width='auto';input.checked=teacher.classIds.includes(school.classId);input.disabled=teacher.id===school.teacherId;input.onchange=async()=>{if(cloud.ready){try{if(input.checked)await cloudResult(cloud.client.from('school_members').insert({class_id:school.classId,user_id:teacher.id,member_role:'teacher'}));else await cloudResult(cloud.client.from('school_members').delete().eq('class_id',school.classId).eq('user_id',teacher.id));await cloudRefresh()}catch(e){cloudMessage(e.message);render()}return}teacher.classIds=input.checked?[...new Set([...teacher.classIds,school.classId])]:teacher.classIds.filter(id=>id!==school.classId);saveSchool();render()};label.append(input,document.createTextNode(withCode(teacher)));assignments.append(label)}
}
document.getElementById('activeSchool').onchange=e=>{school.schoolId=e.target.value;school.classId='';school.studentId='';saveSchool();render()};
document.getElementById('activeClass').onchange=e=>{school.classId=e.target.value;saveSchool();render()};document.getElementById('activeStudent').onchange=e=>{school.studentId=e.target.value;saveSchool();render()};document.getElementById('activeTeacher').onchange=e=>{school.teacherId=e.target.value;saveSchool();render()};
document.getElementById('addClass').onclick=()=>{if(cloud.ready){cloudAdmin('class');return}if(!['admin','manager'].includes(role))return;const input=document.getElementById('newClassName'),name=input.value.trim();if(!name)return;const id=crypto.randomUUID();if(!activeSchoolId())return;school.classes.push({id,name,schoolId:activeSchoolId()});activeTeacher()?.classIds.push(id);school.classId=id;school.studentId='';saveSchool();input.value='';render()};
document.getElementById('addStudent').onclick=()=>{if(cloud.ready){cloudAdmin('student');return}if(!['admin','manager','teacher'].includes(role)||!activeClassId())return;const input=document.getElementById('newStudentName'),name=input.value.trim();if(!name)return;const id=crypto.randomUUID();school.students.push({id,name,classIds:[school.classId]});school.studentId=id;saveSchool();input.value='';render()};
document.getElementById('addTeacher').onclick=()=>{if(cloud.ready){cloudAdmin('teacher');return}if(!['admin','manager'].includes(role))return;const input=document.getElementById('newTeacherName'),name=input.value.trim();if(!name)return;school.teachers.push({id:crypto.randomUUID(),name,classIds:[school.classId]});saveSchool();input.value='';render()};

document.getElementById('addSchool').onclick=()=>{if(cloud.ready){cloudAdmin('school');return}if(role!=='admin')return;const input=document.getElementById('newSchoolName'),name=input.value.trim();if(!name)return;const id=crypto.randomUUID();school.schools.push({id,name,ownerId:school.teacherId});school.schoolId=id;school.classId='';school.studentId='';saveSchool();input.value='';render()};
